@startuml
title Payment-management - lớp nghiệp vụ và cổng ứng dụng (TO-BE)
caption Nguồn: PDF trang 1-3, US-PAY-01..05, PAY-01..08, NFR-PAY-01/02; PAY-DEC-001..015.\nBản cập nhật theo BA R002; phê duyệt PRM-008 chỉ thuộc baseline lịch sử.\nCập nhật 12/11/2026 theo BA R002 / PRM-012; Design Approved (PRM-013).
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Nghiệp vụ" as Domain {
  enum PaymentStatus {
    Draft
    PendingApproval
    Approved
    Rejected
    Cancelled
  }
  class PaymentChain {
    +id: Id
    +rootDocumentId: Id
    +currentApprovedDocumentId: Id [0..1]
    +activeAdjustmentId: Id [0..1]
    +version: Integer
    +hasProcessingAdjustment(): Boolean
    +reserveAdjustment(baseId: Id)
    +activateApproved(documentId: Id)
  }
  class PaymentDocument {
    +id: Id
    +kind: OriginalOrAdjustment
    +status: PaymentStatus
    +originalCreatorId: SubjectId
    +createdBy: SubjectId
    +responsibleId: SubjectId
    +baseApprovedDocumentId: Id [0..1]
    +version: Integer
    +submit(actor, assignment): Submission
    +approve(actor, submissionId)
    +reject(actor, submissionId, reason)
    +reopen(actor): PaymentRevision
    +cancel(actor, reason)
  }
  class PaymentRevision {
    +id: Id
    +revisionNo: Integer
    +note: String
    +exactTotal: ExactDecimal
    +officialTotal: WholeVnd
    +adjustmentReason: String [0..1]
    +delta: WholeVnd [0..1]
    +copyWithNotes(notes): PaymentRevision
  }
  class PaymentLine {
    +lineKey: String
    +serviceId: ExternalId
    +sourceQuantityId: ExternalId
    +priceId: ExternalId
    +serviceFrom: Date
    +serviceTo: Date
    +quantity: ExactDecimal
    +unitPrice: ExactDecimal
    +exactAmount: ExactDecimal
    +amount: WholeVnd
    +note: String
  }
  class SourceSnapshot {
    +id: Id
    +semanticHash: String
    +payload: CanonicalData
    +sourceVersions: VersionVector
    +observedAt: Instant
    +consistencyProof: Data
  }
  class Submission {
    +id: Id
    +roundNo: Integer
    +requiredRole: KTTorGDKD
    +assignedTo: SubjectId
    +assignmentVersion: Integer
    +state: OpenOrDecided
    +reason: String [0..1]
    +recordDecision(actor, decision, reason)
    +reassign(actor, assignee, authorityRef)
  }
  class Evidence {
    +id: Id
    +documentCode: String
    +documentDate: Date
    +confirmedParties: String [1..*]
    +checksum: String
    +blobRef: String
  }
  class MoneyCalculator {
    +calculate(bundle): CalculationResult
  }
  class ApprovalPolicy {
    +select(total, unit, excludedSubjects): Assignment
  }
}

package "Điều phối và cổng" as Application {
  class PaymentService {
    +createOriginal(command)
    +editNotes(id, command)
    +previewRefresh(id)
    +acceptRefresh(id, token)
    +submit(id)
    +approve(id, submissionId)
    +reject(id, submissionId, reason)
    +reopen(id)
    +cancel(id, reason)
    +createAdjustment(baseId, command)
    +reassignApprover(id, command)
    +transferResponsibility(id, command)
  }
  interface SourceGateway {
    +load(contractId, period, mode): SourceBundle
    +compare(snapshot, bundle): SourceDiff
  }
  interface AssignmentDirectory {
    +authorize(actor, action, document)
    +resolveApprover(unit, role, excluded): Assignment
  }
  interface PaymentRepository {
    +loadForUpdate(chainId, documentId)
    +save(aggregate)
  }
  interface UnitOfWork {
    +transaction(work)
  }
  interface EvidenceStore {
    +register(file, metadata): Evidence
    +read(id)
  }
  class NotificationDispatcher {
    +dispatch(outboxId)
    +retry(notificationId)
  }
  interface NotificationChannel {
    +send(recipient, submissionRef): DeliveryResult
  }
}

PaymentChain "1" -- "1..*" PaymentDocument : chứa hồ sơ
Application -[hidden]down-> Domain
SourceGateway -[hidden]down-> AssignmentDirectory
AssignmentDirectory -[hidden]down-> EvidenceStore
PaymentRepository -[hidden]down-> UnitOfWork
UnitOfWork -[hidden]down-> NotificationChannel
PaymentDocument "0..*" --> "0..1" PaymentDocument : baseApproved
PaymentDocument "1" *-- "1..*" PaymentRevision : lịch sử nội dung
PaymentDocument "1" *-- "0..*" Submission : lần trình
PaymentRevision "1" *-- "0..*" PaymentLine : dòng theo đoạn giá
PaymentRevision "0..*" --> "1" SourceSnapshot : căn cứ bất biến
PaymentRevision "0..*" --> "0..1" Evidence : biên bản
Submission "0..1" --> "1" PaymentRevision : cố định nội dung
PaymentDocument --> PaymentStatus
PaymentService ..> PaymentDocument
PaymentService ..> PaymentChain
PaymentService ..> SourceGateway
PaymentService ..> AssignmentDirectory
PaymentService ..> PaymentRepository
PaymentService ..> UnitOfWork
PaymentService ..> MoneyCalculator
PaymentService ..> ApprovalPolicy
PaymentService ..> EvidenceStore
ApprovalPolicy ..> AssignmentDirectory
NotificationDispatcher ..> PaymentRepository
NotificationDispatcher ..> NotificationChannel

note bottom of PaymentChain
  Một Original; nhiều Adjustment nối tiếp.
  PAY-DEC-015: tối đa một Draft/PendingApproval/Rejected.
  Guard và cờ bàn giao xét TOÀN CHUỖI, kể cả xem bản cũ.
  Approved/Cancelled chỉ kết thúc vị trí chính hồ sơ.
  Tổng hiệu lực lấy bản Approved hiện hành, không cộng các bản.
end note
note bottom of PaymentRevision
  Revision append-only; reopen tạo bản sao mới.
  Decimal chính xác; HALF_UP từng dòng đến đồng.
  Không sửa Approved; quyền xử lý không thay creator.
end note
@enduml
